# Paths deleted from the vendored subcharts after `helm dependency update`.
# One path per line, relative to this chart directory. Comments with #.
#
# The upstream loki chart declares minio as a conditional dependency so that
# someone trying the chart out gets object storage without an S3 account.
# It is gated on minio.enabled, which defaults to false, and we point Loki at
# s3.obmondo.com instead, so it renders nothing. The published tarball bundles
# it regardless, which is why this file exists: without it the subchart comes
# back on the next version bump.
charts/loki/charts/minio
